# Local toolchain pin for this repo.
#
# scarb 2.20.0 aligns the corelib (v2.20.0) with the cairo-lang 2.20 crates
# used by crates/zk-circuit and crates/zk-vendor/stwo-sys, and is the version
# that understands the Cairo executable ABI. See
# docs/architecture/zk-stwo-cairo-executable-recipe.md.
#
# CI does not use asdf: it installs scarb directly in
# .github/workflows/{zk-capability-circuit,ci,coverage}.yml, so those pins
# must be kept in step with this file.
#
# Only `scarb` is listed. asdf resolves each tool independently and falls
# through to the global ~/.tool-versions for anything omitted here, so the
# repo file does not shadow your personal Cairo tooling.
scarb 2.20.0
